## Todo app example
a task is a thing
a task has a title as text
a task has a property completed as yes or no
a task "is complete" if its completed is yes
a task "is active" if its completed is no

a todos-app is an app
a todos-app has a property tasks as a new List
a todos-app has a property newTaskName
a todos-app has a filter as one of all, active or completed

set app to a new todos-app
set the filter of the app to "all"
set the newTaskName of the app to ""

to create a new task (with title as text, completed as a choice)
	if the title is undefined
		if the newTaskName of the app is "" return
		set the title to the newTaskName of the app
		set the newTaskName of the app to ""
	get a new task with title = the title, completed = the completed or no
	add it to the tasks of the app

create a new task with title = "Create todos app", completed = yes
create a new task with title = "Teach it to draw"
create a new task with title = "Test app"

to draw (a todos-app)
	return
		<ui-container>
			<ui-segment>
				<ui-menu inverted color="violet" borderless>
					<ui-item type="header">To Do:</ui-item>
					<ui-menu position="right">
						<ui-item>Show:</ui-item>
						<ui-item onClick={set the filter of the app to "all"} selected={the filter of the app is "all"}>All</ui-item>
						<ui-item onClick={set the filter of the app to "active"} selected={the filter of the app is "active"}>Active</ui-item>
						<ui-item onClick={set the filter of the app to "completed"} selected={the filter of the app is "completed"}>Completed</ui-item>
					</ui-menu>
				</ui-menu>
				<ui-form debug value={the app}>
					<ui-repeat name="tasks">
						<ui-fields>
							<ui-field width="1"><ui-checkbox name="completed" aria-label="Done"/></ui-field>
							<ui-field width="10"><ui-input name="title" aria-label="Task"/></ui-field>
						</ui-fields>
					</ui-repeat>
					<ui-fields>
						<ui-field width="11"><ui-input name="newTaskName" placeholder="New task name" label="New task:"/></ui-field>
						<ui-field><ui-button disabled={the newTaskName of the app is ""} onClick={create a new task}>Add Task</ui-button></ui-field>
					</ui-fields>
				</ui-form>
				<br/>
				<br/>
				<ui-menu inverted color="grey">
					<ui-item type="header">Test:</ui-item>
					<ui-item onClick={create a new task with title = "Moar"}>Add Item</ui-item>
					<ui-item onClick={remove the first item of the tasks of the app}>Remove Item</ui-item>
					<ui-item onClick={set the title of the first item of the tasks of the app to "New title"}>Change name</ui-item>
					<ui-item onClick={remove items in (the tasks of the app) where it is complete}>Remove Completed</ui-item>
				</ui-menu>
			</ui-segment>
		</ui-container>

start the app
print the app
